id=com.operit.handlehide
name=Hide Nav Pill
author=operit
version=1.5
versionCode=6
description=Hides the gesture navigation pill (home handle) on PixelOS Android 17. Skips rasterisation of Launcher3 StashedHandleView via View.draw so the handle is never drawn, while keeping the View visible and hit-testable (Circle to Search long-press preserved). Layout, insets and gestures untouched (v6).
